("DR-258","Model registry tables (`models`, `model_versions`, `model_evaluations`, `model_kill_state`, `model_monitor_points`) are in `admin`; `model_scores` is in `alert` so its composite FK points into partitioned `alert.alerts` (RESTRICT) and it takes the R5 owner clock","The FK into a partitioned table needs `(id, created_at)`; phase 23 purges scores before an alert partition drop"),
("DR-259","A family and each of its versions are inventory items of kind `model`; shadow, challenger and live scoring all need the version item `approved_for_use`; promotion to live is a change request on `cr_material_validated`","GV-01, GV-32 and the phase 04 gate; a shadow score is a use of the model"),
