("DR-261","`ort` pinned and vendored, `tract` per-version fallback when golden rows fail, both in `akr-worker` only (new crate `crates/ml`); verify-only Ed25519 keys in OpenBao KV `keys/model-artifact/v<N>.pub`; signature and hash checked at import and at every load (worker start, promotion, switch release, every 10 minutes)","TS-16, ort release-candidate status, phase 00 signed-bundle rule"),
("DR-262","A version's validation is phase 24's pack with the seven part keys given a model meaning; validator never the owner; a `pass` moves inventory dates through phase 04; promotion needs a pack issued after the shadow started","GV-09 and GV-15 are carried by phase 24; one evidence path"),
("DR-263","Label gates count QA-confirmed outcomes over every tier (positives: STR, UTR, TFR; negatives: no-report including phase 19 `low_score_forced`): 50 to recalibrate a starter family, 200 to enter shadow, 500 to go live for a bank-trained family; governed settings with floors","T-15, research 21 4f (lead review: phase 18 raises the subject to `suspicion` on every report decision, so excluding that tier lost almost every positive)"),
